    <briefdescription>
<para>Fallback strategy for handling cardinality overflow. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When a metric&apos;s cardinality exceeds its limit, a fallback strategy determines how to handle new, previously-unseen label sets. </para>
